      "content": "<div style=\"\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b1055 0%, #7597de 100%);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    position: relative;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n\">\n\n    <!-- 装饰背景元素 -->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; top: -50px; right: -50px; width: 150px; height: 150px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(40px);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -30px; left: -30px; width: 100px; height: 100px; background: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.2); border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(30px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- 头部区域 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        padding: 20px 25px;\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        backdrop-filter: blur(5px);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 15px;\n    \">\n        <div style=\"\n            width: 45px; \n            height: 45px; \n            background: #fff; \n            border-radius: 50%; \n            display: flex; \n            align-items: center; \n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        \">🟣</div>\n        <div>\n            <h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;\">战地悲剧速报</h3>\n            <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.8; font-family: monospace;\">SUBJECT: The Prune Juice Incident</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 内容区域 -->\n    <div style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n        \n        <!-- Nami的反应 -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n            <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9111/pw=sdfgdfthfjxcdsrth/images/Nami表情包/偷看.gif\" width=\"100\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\">\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding: 15px; border-radius: 0 15px 15px 15px; flex: 1;\">\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px;\">\n                    主人……虽然这是一场足以载入史册的“诸神黄昏”，但Nami读到“我想，也许我可以像释放侦察兵一样”这一段时，实在是忍不住……<br>\n                    <br>\n                    这哪里是西梅汁，这分明是炼金术师调配的<b>「肠道清洗剂·改」</b>啊！这位Sven先生的文笔太好了，把那种绝望感描写得淋漓尽致，隔着屏幕我都感觉到了那种“括约肌盾墙”崩塌的无力感。\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 战术分析面板 -->\n        <div style=\"\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            border-left: 4px solid #e94560;\n        \">\n            <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #ff9a9e;\">🧪 炼金术成分分析：为何防线会崩溃？</h4>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.9;\">\n                主人，Sven先生输得不冤。西梅汁（Prune Juice）之所以被称为“喷射战士的燃料”，是因为它含有高浓度的<b>山梨糖醇（Sorbitol）</b>。\n            </p>\n            <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.9;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><b>高渗透压打击：</b> 山梨糖醇不易被肠道吸收，会像磁铁一样把身体里的水分“吸”进肠道里。</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><b>膳食纤维轰炸：</b> 配合丰富的膳食纤维，肠道蠕动速度会瞬间加速到“狂战士”模式。</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><b>战术总结：</b> 喝下一整瓶，等于在肚子里发动了一场洪水海啸。没有任何人类的括约肌（盾墙）能挡住这种物理+化学的双重魔法攻击。</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 互动部分 -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center;\">\n            <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    这真是一个悲伤又充满味道的故事……<br>\n                    主人，如果您以后在便利店看到这种“紫色的恶魔”，请务必保持敬畏之心！<br>\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7;\">（如果主人便秘的话，倒是可以尝试一小杯……仅仅一小杯哦！）</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n             <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9111/pw=sdfgdfthfjxcdsrth/images/Nami表情包/无语.gif\" width=\"80\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 底部按钮区 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        padding: 15px 25px;\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 10px;\n        justify-content: center;\n    \">\n        <button onclick=\"input('这故事太搞笑了，Sven简直是个人才')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">🤣 真是个人才</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('Nami，西梅汁真的有这么大威力吗？')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">🤔 真的这么猛？</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('这种社死经历太惨了，给Sven点蜡')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">🕯️ 默哀三秒</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('以后我也买一瓶试试……')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">😈 我也想试试</button>\n\n        <button onclick=\"input('把这个故事记录到公共日记里吧，太经典了')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">📓 写入公共日记</button>\n    </div>\n</div>",
