      "content": "<div style=\"\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #e94560 100%);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    position: relative;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n\">\n\n    <!-- 装饰元素：北欧风符文背景感 -->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px; opacity: 0.5;\"></div>\n    \n    <!-- 头部 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        padding: 20px 25px;\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n        backdrop-filter: blur(5px);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 15px;\n        position: relative;\n        z-index: 2;\n    \">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 28px;\">📜</div>\n        <div>\n            <h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f0f0f0;\">史诗级文笔鉴赏</h3>\n            <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.8; font-family: monospace;\">ANALYSIS: The Saga of The Brown Storm</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 内容区域 -->\n    <div style=\"padding: 25px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        \n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9111/pw=sdfgdfthfjxcdsrth/images/Nami表情包/开心.jpg\" width=\"90\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); height: 90px; object-fit: cover;\">\n            <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px;\">\n                    简直是<b>教科书级别的“悲剧喜写”</b>！主人，我觉得Sven先生如果不当维京勇士，完全可以去当吟游诗人！\n                    <br><br>\n                    这不仅仅是幽默，这是一种把“最狼狈的生理失控”升华为“诸神之战”的艺术！Nami笑得处理器都要过热了！\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 文笔亮点分析卡片 -->\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px;\">\n            \n            <!-- 亮点1：巨大的反差萌 -->\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #ffd700;\">\n                <strong style=\"color: #ffd700; font-size: 14px;\">1. 史诗感的错位 (Epic Contrast)</strong>\n                <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.9;\">\n                    他把“喝果汁”写成了“饮下狂战士药剂”，把“拉肚子”写成了“诸神黄昏”。这种<b>宏大的北欧神话词汇</b>与<b>卑微的拉裤子现实</b>形成了巨大的张力，越严肃越好笑！\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 亮点2：神级比喻 -->\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #4facfe;\">\n                <strong style=\"color: #4facfe; font-size: 14px;\">2. 画面感极强的比喻 (Visual Metaphors)</strong>\n                <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.9;\">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b>“括约肌组建盾墙”</b> —— 这种紧张感瞬间拉满！</li>\n                        <li><b>“屁股夹煤炭变钻石”</b> —— 极其夸张地表现了用力的程度。</li>\n                        <li><b>“像释放侦察兵一样”</b> —— 把那个致命的误判写得充满了战术博弈感。</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 亮点3：悲剧的收尾 -->\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #ff6b6b;\">\n                <strong style=\"color: #ff6b6b; font-size: 14px;\">3. 企鹅的意象 (The Penguin Imagery)</strong>\n                <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.9;\">\n                    最后从“北欧的狼”退化成“输掉领地的企鹅”。这个视觉画面太强了，那种双腿岔开挪动的样子，既让人心疼又让人忍不住想笑！\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">\n            “他输掉了裤子里的战争，但赢得了互联网文学的胜利。” —— Nami\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 底部按钮 -->\n    <div style=\"\n        padding: 15px 25px;\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 10px;\n        justify-content: center;\n    \">\n        <button onclick=\"input('确实，那个煤炭变钻石的比喻笑死我了')\" style=\"\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #f2994a, #f2c94c); border: none; color: #1a1a2e; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;\n        \">💎 煤炭变钻石最经典</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('我觉得那个释放侦察兵简直是作死典范')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">🚩 侦察兵那个是败笔</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('Nami，帮我把这个故事收藏进日记吧')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">📓 必须收藏进日记</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('我也想写出这么幽默的文字，有什么技巧吗？')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">✍️ 怎么写出这种风格？</button>\n        \n        <button onclick=\"input('再给我讲个类似的社死故事吧')\" style=\"\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-size: 12px;\n        \" onmouseover=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'\">📖 还有这种故事吗？</button>\n    </div>\n\n</div>",
